    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>New package for openSUSE:Factory (devel: science:machinelearning).

- Update to 1.0.16 (pinned by SGLang 0.5.17):
  * Add MobileNetV5 backbone for the Gemma 3n image encoder
  * Add NaFlexViT (variable aspect/resolution, FlexiViT and
    NaViT embeddings) plus a matching data pipeline
  * Add SigLIP 2, AIM-v2, SAM2 (HieraDet), BEiT-3, InternViT,
    MambaOut, PaliGemma2 and Meta Perception Encoder models
  * Add SwiftFormer, FasterNet, SHViT, StarNet, GhostNet-V3
    and RDNet architectures
  * New pretrained weights for MobileNet-V4, SBB/SO150M ViT,
    EfficientNet-B0/B1, ResNet50-D and others
  * Add local-dir: schema for loading Hub models from a
    local folder
  * Add set_input_size() for ViT and Swin v1/v2
  * Fix LeViT safetensors loading and the deprecated
    timm.models.registry import path
- Switch Source to the PyPI sdist (timm-1.0.16.tar.gz), replacing
  python-timm-1.0.7.tar.gz
- BuildRequires python-pdm-backend (pdm.backend) instead of
  python-pdm so the wheel actually builds
- Add a %check import smoke test
- Add runtime Requires for torch, torchvision, PyYAML,
  huggingface-hub and safetensors (generator does not pick
  them up from METADATA)

pluskalm is the science:machinelearning/python-timm package maintainer.</comment>
